{"symbol":"PKP.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:55:42Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Grójecka 17","city":"Warsaw","zip":"02-021","country":"Poland","phone":"48 801 02 20 42","fax":"48 224 74 16 45","website":"https://www.pkpcargo.com","industry":"Railroads","industryKey":"railroads","industryDisp":"Railroads","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Pkp Cargo S.A. engages in the provision of logistics services in the field of rail freight in Poland and internationally. The company offers rail freight transport services for coal, coke, aggregates, building materials, liquid fuels, chemicals, metals and ores, timber and agricultural crops, emergency and military transports, and automotive products. It also provides intermodal transportation services, such as transport of goods through various means of transport, including train, ship, and road; and railway, road, sea, and air forwarding services, as well as operates transhipment terminals, warehouses, and logistics centers. In addition, the company offers railway siding services, such as railway traction vehicles for wagon switching, shunting and operation of wagon handling equipment, train clearance from sidings, forwarding and commercial documentation, and diagnostics and maintenance of railway siding infrastructure; and maintains and repairs rolling stock items. Further, it is involved in the maintenance, repairing, and retrofitting of wagons and locomotives; inspections, maintenance, and emergency repairing of rolling stock; and reclamation work, earthwork, construction, demolition, and other project activities. The company serves mining, metallurgical, construction, chemical, timber, food, and automotive industries. Pkp Cargo S.A. was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland.","companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Pawel  Milek","title":"Vice -President of the Management Board & Restructuring Director","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":